  "stageId": "a003_04",
  "title": "他是将军",
  "storyCode": "OF-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4cd92d443d50eb81126a638a10a8f28086184b550a801f8c2fa9b9e5a8380802",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "A队，B队，远处盯紧了。C队，从后面包围。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "佣兵团的风格吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "有几分实力，训练的人有些水准，不过，还不够。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "这，这个老头好强！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "不在一个等级上。你们在旁边守好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "（这个女人......不简单。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "（这些保镖虽然伤不到我，但她能够对我造成威胁。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "愚蠢的外地人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "（她很愤怒。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "（站在她的立场上，或许真的是认为我们蒙骗了锡兰小姐。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "（但是，有哪里不对。这个人到底是......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "不愧是经验丰富的佣兵，即使你家小姐被带走也没有乱了阵脚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "说什么废话！既然你知道我们头曾经是......咕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "闭嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "（......嗯？等等......弩，菲林，这个名字。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "（我在哪里听说过这个名字......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "等等，这老头要干什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "（虽然有些担忧博士那边的情况。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "（......不过以博士的能力，加之汐斯塔市内还有其他人在，应当问题不大。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "他往我们这边冲了，他疯了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保镖",
      "text": "快，快拦住他！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "text": "太慢了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
